WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.021
An opinion becomes more convincing when explained with relevant reasons and examples.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:10.874
What is a respectful way to disagree? Answer: I understand your view, but here is

00:00:10.874 --> 00:00:11.541
another reason.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:15.225
Write a reasoned paragraph about daily reading at home.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:19.567
Why it works: Reasoned disagreement stays respectful.
